# NOTE: assets/assistant-config.js IS committed deliberately — it holds only the
# PUBLIC Cloudflare Worker proxy URL (no secret; the Gemini key lives inside the
# Worker, server-side). It must ship so the generative assistant works on Pages.

# NOTE: content/*.js ARE committed deliberately — they are the deployable runtime
# (the static site loads them directly). Regenerate them with `node tools/build.js`
# after editing lessons/*.md, then re-run `node tools/qa.js` before pushing.
